    <item>
      <title>Scandinavia House in New York closed due to safety precautions against COVID-19</title>
      <link>https://thedanishpioneer.com/scandinavia-house-in-new-york-closed-due-to-safety-precautions-against-covid-19/</link>
      <description>As of Monday, March 16, 2020, Scandinavia House in New York City is closed until further advisement regarding ongoing safety precautions against COVID-19. This includes SmorgasChef Restaurant, the Shop, the Children’s Center, and all other spaces. Programming is currently postponed. Please visit http://www.scandinaviahouse.org for updates.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://thedanishpioneer.com/scandinavia-house-in-new-york-closed-due-to-safety-precautions-against-covid-19/</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://thedanishpioneer.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Auxiliary-Daisies-150x150.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Mar 2020 05:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
